commit 360ea216b8e60ad768d678d2730b5451e229016f

C03: the shell's File Explorer entry is identified by its process, not by a title prefix (APPS1237 repair)

Explorer windows are titled «<carpeta> - Explorador de archivos»: the
application name is a suffix, so the title rule never matched and the catalog
id carries no executable; the launched window was on screen while app.open
reported verification_failed (APPS1235/000, /001). explorer.exe is the identity
for that one entry. No tests (owner order).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


